; c16-4t-both-high. Anchor: shot-0233 (Ch. 16, four trumps, continued).
; Printed: 6 of the 14 bad placements (6/14 if read inside the bad ones,
;   6/27 if read over all placements).
; Claim: in the c16-4t-two-of-three shape, one opponent holds both of the two
;   highest missing trumps.
; State: as c16-4t-two-of-three; read conditionally, also given that query.
; Exact: 1/5 over all deals; 19/47 given an opponent holds two missing trumps.
;   Book model: 6/27 and 3/7.
;
; t and s are the two highest trumps in hidden hands.
(query (roles (chair v) (chair x) (domino t) (domino s))
  (out)
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (opponent v x)
    (in t q*)
    (in s q*)
    (none (roles (domino u) (chair y)) (in u q*) (beats u t q*) (not (viewer y)) (holds y u))
    (none (roles (domino w) (chair z))
      (in w q*)
      (beats w s q*)
      (not (tile w t))
      (not (viewer z))
      (holds z w))
    (holds x t)
    (holds x s)))
